  <teiHeader xml:lang="en">
    <fileDesc>
      <titleStmt>
        <title level="a" type="main">Low-Rank Adapters for Sparse Transformers</title>
      </titleStmt>
    </fileDesc>
    <profileDesc>
      <abstract>
        <div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
          <p><s>We study low-rank adapters for sparse transformers.</s><s>Our method reduces memory by 3x.</s></p>
        </div>
      </abstract>
    </profileDesc>
  </teiHeader>
  <text xml:lang="en">
    <body>
      <div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
        <head n="1">Introduction</head>
        <p><s>Large models are expensive to fine-tune <ref type="bibr" target="#b0">[1]</ref>.</s><s>Adapters help <ref type="bibr" target="#b1">[2]</ref>.</s></p>
        <p><s>We extend LoRA to sparse attention.</s></p>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
        <head n="2">Method</head>
        <p><s>Let W be a weight matrix.</s><s>We learn A and B with rank r.</s></p>
        <formula xml:id="formula_0">W' = W + BA</formula>
        <div>
          <head n="2.1">Sparsity</head>
          <p><s>Attention is restricted to a local window.</s></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
